Replace custom VSphereProblemDetectorDeploymentController with common DeploymentController and add cloud-config ConfigMap and vSphere credentials Secret hashes to the vsphere-problem-detector Deployment.

As result, vsphere-problem-detector is restarted after credentials change and thus should check the new credentials or cloud config quickly (= in 2-3 minutes, because of leader election). Therefore, any alert about bad credentials will be cleared 2-3 minutes after user provides the right ones.

